Sangam - sangam-flowable-ports
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0

This module re-implements on Operaton the logic of several Flowable classes
(Flowable, https://github.com/flowable/flowable-engine, Copyright Flowable AG
and contributors, Apache License 2.0). No Flowable source file is copied; the
logic and SPI shapes of the following were used:

  - AdhocSubProcessActivityBehavior, RuntimeService ad-hoc API      -> org.sangam.ports.adhoc
  - InboundEventDeserializer / KeyDetector / TenantDetector /
    PayloadExtractor, OutboundEventSerializer, channel/event models -> org.sangam.ports.events
  - HitPolicyPriority, HitPolicyOutputOrder, OutputOrderComparator  -> org.sangam.ports.dmn.PriorityHitPolicies
  - Inject*Cmd (dynamic BPMN injection)                             -> org.sangam.ports.dynamic
  - VariableAggregationDefinition                                   -> org.sangam.ports.variables
  - SkipExpressionUtil, TriggerableJavaDelegate,
    TerminateEventDefinition terminateAll/terminateMultiInstance    -> org.sangam.ports.bpmn
  - external-job REST request/response shapes                       -> org.sangam.ports.worker

The local Flowable checkout ships a LICENSE but no NOTICE file.
Flowable's ProcessDiagramLayoutFactory is NOT used (XXE CVE-2026-91197).

Optional third-party clients (not bundled unless the deployment adds them):
  - org.apache.kafka:kafka-clients 3.9.1      Apache-2.0
  - jakarta.jms:jakarta.jms-api 3.1.0         EPL-2.0 OR GPL-2.0-with-Classpath-exception
  - com.rabbitmq:amqp-client 5.25.0           Apache-2.0 / MPL-2.0 / GPL-2.0 (used under Apache-2.0)
